## SQ-RDB-02 | /dumpall: Rustic recipes, tags, loot and items equal the 2026-11-10 baseline (kubejs/exported copied in by prep)
@group A
@commands `/dumpall`; compare `recipes/all.csv` rusticdelight rows, `tags/item_tags.json` and `tags/block_tags.json` rusticdelight entries, `loot_tables/` rusticdelight with the baseline
@pass Same recipe ids (270, 267 in the 2026-11-19 pack dump), same loot tables and items; tag members equal except the two intended baseline-only groups (`rusticdelight:raw_cooked_eggs` entries, `powergrid:affected_by_lamp` rustic crops)
@fails Diff names the file; check its `bake_manifest.json` rules
@from batches/r1113/c4_a.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-26
# rewritten 2026-11-26 (r1126q writer-5): r1120nv's compare exited 1 on two intended tag changes (the baseline is the instance's older dump, taken before D19's egg tag and Power Grid's lamp tag). The new shell steps count the three bake-owned kinds SAME and allow only those two baseline-only tag groups
shell rm -rf rdb_base && cp -r kubejs/exported rdb_base && echo "baseline copied: $(grep -c '^rusticdelight:' rdb_base/recipes/all.csv) rusticdelight recipes"
> dumpall
waitlog \[dumpall\] (all \d+ dumps done|\d+/\d+ (dumps )?ok) 900
shell python3 $INST/tools/scratch_query/rdb_compare.py rdb_base kubejs/exported rusticdelight > ../rdb_out.txt; cat ../rdb_out.txt; true
shell test "$(grep -cE '^\[rdb\] (recipes|loot_tables|items) base=[0-9]+ now=[0-9]+ SAME' ../rdb_out.txt)" = 3
shell test "$(grep -E '^\[rdb\]   only now: ' ../rdb_out.txt | wc -l)" = 0
shell test "$(grep -E '^\[rdb\]   only base: ' ../rdb_out.txt | grep -vE 'rusticdelight:raw_cooked_eggs <- |powergrid:affected_by_lamp <- rusticdelight:' | wc -l)" = 0
look recipes, loot_tables and items SAME; the only tag differences are entries only in the baseline: `rusticdelight:raw_cooked_eggs` members (now follows #creativedelight:eggs/fryable: no turtle, parrot or Alex's eggs, owner rows 1120 G2a, D19) and `powergrid:affected_by_lamp` without the five rustic crops (Power Grid's own tag, not the bake); anything only in "now" or any other tag is a finding

